.TH SCENE_STACK_MAX 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
SCENE_STACK_MAX \- Maximum number of scenes on the stack at once
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.ft B
#define SCENE_STACK_MAX 8
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Maximum number of scenes on the stack at once. A push beyond it is dropped and logged. Eight is plenty: gameplay, pause, options, confirm is four.
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR engine_push (3),
.BR Engine (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
